  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 257 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E14", "E17"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows Hospira, Inc., a Pfizer Company, plans to discontinue cisatracurium besylate injection with supply expected to exhaust November 2026, initially posted 2026-09-11.",
      "cites": ["E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant on our products' labels, Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited, received an OAI classification on 2026-02-06, which is 257 days before the shortage posting date.",
      "cites": ["E14", "E17", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited on 2024-08-15 following prior OAI findings.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 67 units at 6.8 per day for 10 days on hand, while Corvale Lakeside holds 23 units at 0.8 per day for 30 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer 12 units from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East; Lakeside would retain 11 units (14 days on hand) and East would reach 79 units (12 days on hand).",
